{"id":"confianza","lemma":"confianza","pos":"noun","rank":920,"glosses":["confidence, trust"],"ipa":"/konˈfjanθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"confianzas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-confianza.wav","examples":[{"text":"La confianza se gana.","en":"Trust is earned.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442253"},{"text":"Tom perdió su confianza.","en":"Tom lost their trust.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/162891"},{"text":"Quizá pequé de confianza.","en":"Maybe I was too confident.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/728792"},{"text":"Ellos son de poca confianza.","en":"They're unreliable.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501683"},{"text":"Él no es de confianza.","en":"He cannot be relied on.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636733"}]}